# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# The router owns deep paths (/projects/:id, /estimates/:id, /billing/return,
# /reset-password, …). Without this rule the host looks for a real file at that
# path and returns 404 on: a browser refresh, a shared deep link, the monobank
# return redirect, and an installed PWA relaunching onto a sub-route.
#
# 200 (not 301) = rewrite, so the URL the user sees is preserved and the router
# picks it up on boot. Assets are served before this rule, so /assets/* is unaffected.
/*    /index.html   200
